<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14138043/ctd-logo_original.png" style="width: 158px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Logo" width="158" height="115"></td></tr></table>
<h2 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Reminder: Register for Professional Development Day for Managers on September 21.</h2>
<table class="gd_combo_table" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
  <tr>
    <td>
      <img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14173151/7062200/light-brown-creative-ripped-photo-frame-moments-mem_crop.png" style="width: 179px; height: auto !important; float: right; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Reno CTD" width="179" height="228" align="right" hspace="7">
      <p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Managers are often focused on helping others, but Professional Development Day for Managers on September 21 will focus on YOU and your growth as a leader.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Attendees will explore resources, network, and learn more about dedicated offerings available through CTD, including one-on-one coaching and leadership development programs.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This event is planned as an open house, and attendees may participate throughout the afternoon as their schedules permit.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019fc9126ecc7c36b77168f7cfea96d6?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Register today.</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>NOTE: </strong>If you registered for the August 17 session, your registration will carry over and you do not need to take any action. <strong>New registrations are being accepted through September 21.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Professional Development Day for Managers</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Date: Monday, September 21, 2026</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Time: 1:00 pm. – 4:00 p.m.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Place: 1111 E. Broad St., Columbus, OH 43205 (Jerry Hammond Building)</strong></p>
