    <item>
      <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 08:45:12 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>Register: Professional Development Day for Managers on September 21</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">69721216</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/427dc80</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">

</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14138043/ctd-logo_original.png" style="width: 158px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Logo" width="158" height="115"></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Citywide Training and Development is excited to share that Professional Development Day for Managers has been rescheduled!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As CTD launches a new era with the renovation of its space at 1111 E. Broad Street, the team is welcoming managers and leaders for an afternoon of connection and development on <span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong>September 21</strong></span>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This event is planned as an open house, and attendees may participate throughout the afternoon as their schedules permit. The open house will include professional development opportunities ranging from mini training sessions to interactive stations and networking, and much more.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you registered for the August 17 session, your registration will carry over and you do not need to take any action. <strong>New registrations are being accepted through September 21.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019fc9126ecc7c36b77168f7cfea96d6?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Register.</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Professional Development Day for Managers</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Date: Monday, September 21, 2026</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Time: 1:00 pm. – 4:00 p.m.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Place: 1111 E. Broad St., Columbus, OH 43205 (Jerry Hammond Building)</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>“Citywide Training has an incredible team, led by Training Manager Drema Kirkling. The group is thoughtful, professional, and invested in helping others achieve their goals. They are an essential resource and have changed the trajectory of many teams, employees, and residents across the City. Learning and education are at the core of CTD’s work, and their commitment is critical to our department’s role in making the City’s vision a reality: <strong>A Columbus where equitable opportunities foster prosperity for all who call Columbus home.</strong></em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><em>If you are interested in networking with fellow managers, learning how CTD’s programs can strengthen your team, or just want to engage with CTD’s amazing team of trainers and coaches who are committed to making Columbus better, I highly encourage you to join us at this event and to take advantage of the services available to you through CTD.” </em></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Director Alysha Martin</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>*Please note: This session is open to employees with manager titles and above.</strong></p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/09/14283514/7099954/professional-development-day-2026-flyer_crop.png" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Professional Development Day" width="560" height="725">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 07:40:11 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>FREE: Positive Parenting Program (Triple P Seminars)</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">69672776</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/4271f48</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14256193/7090361/positive-parenting-email-banner_crop.jpg" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Triple P Header Image Fall 2026" width="600" height="220">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>FREE TRAINING FOR CITY EMPLOYEES</strong></p>
<h1 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left"><strong>Positive Parenting Program (Triple P Seminars)</strong></h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Columbus Public Health’s Positive Parenting Program is for parents and caregivers of children ages 0–12 who want guidance on supporting their child’s growth. You’ll get practical ideas, connect with other parents, and get support with parenting challenges. All 90-minute sessions are held via Webex.</p>
<hr>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Helping Children Develop Healthy Screentime Habits </strong>(Triple P Seminar 4)<br>September 16, 11:30 a.m.-1 p.m.</p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Topics include healthy screentime habits and recommendations, how to resolve screentime problems, and online safety.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Register at <a href="https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/b32c6647-0a83-46e9-9579-18aee2c358ae?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/b32c6647-0a83-46e9-9579-18aee2c358ae</a>.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>The Power of Positive Parenting </strong>(Triple P Seminar 1)<br>October 21, 11:30 a.m.-1 p.m.</p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Topics include having a loving, safe and positive learning environment, using assertive discipline, and taking care of yourself as a parent.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Register at <a href="https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/4e849121-e136-4ce6-8ed6-ca5e7156fdd2?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/4e849121-e136-4ce6-8ed6-ca5e7156fdd2</a>.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Raising Confident, Competent Children </strong>(Triple P Seminar 2)<br>November 18, 11:30 a.m.-1 p.m.</p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Topics include being considerate and respectful of others, having good social skills and self-esteem, and being an independent problem solver.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Register at <a href="https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/cb3a7c38-0338-40eb-abfa-6e11ddca2dc7?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/cb3a7c38-0338-40eb-abfa-6e11ddca2dc7</a>.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Raising Resilient Children </strong>(Triple P Seminar 3)<br>December 16, 11:30 a.m.-1 p.m.</p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Topics include recognizing and expressing feelings, developing positive outlook and coping mechanisms, and managing strong emotions and stressful events.</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">Register at <a href="https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/123f7362-e4f5-4e9b-9815-a1a38a1e1b80?session=22c04e80-5111-4d64-baa8-0b686c8ba58f&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://cityofcolumbus.csod.com/ui/lms-learning-details/app/event/123f7362-e4f5-4e9b-9815-a1a38a1e1b80?session=22c04e80-5111-4d64-baa8-0b686c8ba58f</a>.</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
